    <briefdescription>
<para>An object of this class is returned by queries that could not be answered. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For example, if you ask for the number of iterations of a linked-list traversal loop, you will get one of these. None of the standard <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_c_e_v" kindref="compound">SCEV</ref> operations are valid on this class, it is just a marker. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
